# ── Disposable run evidence ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Browser output regenerates on every run and is worthless once the SHA moves.
# Publish it as a GitHub Actions artifact instead of committing it; PR #8 had
# reached 179.8 MB of tracked proof, 139 MB of it PNG.
# Durable, reviewable summaries (.csv/.md/small .json) stay tracked.
proof/**/*.webm
proof/**/*.zip
proof/**/*.trace
proof/**/trace/
proof/**/test-results/
proof/**/playwright-report/
proof/**/*-trace.json
proof/**/videos/
proof/**/video/
apps/web/test-results/
apps/web/playwright-report/

# Local audit dumps: machine-specific paths, never part of the product.
audit-output/

# Run evidence regenerates on demand and is meaningless once the SHA moves.
# Publish it as a CI artifact; keep only the compact summaries a human reads.
proof/**/*.png
proof/**/*.jpg
proof/**/*.jpeg
proof/**/*.webm
proof/**/*.mp4
proof/**/*.gif
proof/**/*.trace
